        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "The penguin consults a very small ledger. \"Your lot already sent someone. <CUSTOM6600>, it says here. One per household -- go and have a word with them, and if they hand their things back the spot is yours.\""
